---
import Layout from '../layouts/FrontDoor.astro';
import clipsData from '../data/clips.json';

const clips = clipsData.clips;
---

<Layout
  title="Watch it"
  description="Verified gameplay clips from GameBoyGhost's own runs, frame-checked against the recorded game state."
>
  <h1>Watch it</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Every clip is re-rendered from a single boot-state load by input replay only, then hash-checked
    against the recorded run frame by frame. A clip with a <a class="badge" href="/data-publishing/#how-the-footage-is-made">verified replay</a>
    badge matched on every frame.
  </p>

  <p>
    The <strong>GIFs are the shareable unit</strong> — grab one, drop it anywhere. The video and its
    provenance are the proof behind it.
  </p>

  <div class="gallery">
    {clips.map((clip) => (
      <figure class="clip">
        <video controls muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster={clip.poster}>
          <source src={clip.webm} type="video/webm" />
        </video>
        <figcaption>
          <div class="clip-head">
            <a class="badge" href="/data-publishing/#how-the-footage-is-made">verified replay</a>
            <span class="mono clip-speed">{clip.speed}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="clip-title">{clip.title}</div>
          <div class="clip-caption">{clip.caption}</div>
          <a class="mono clip-grab" href={clip.gif}>grab the GIF</a>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p class="lede" style="margin-top:2rem">
    More clips are on the way — the full capture set will be added here as each clip's caption and
    verification digest are pulled from its media manifest.
  </p>
</Layout>

<style>
  .gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
  .clip { margin: 0; }
  .clip video, .clip img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 160 / 144;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: #000;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: block;
  }
  .clip-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; margin: 0.6rem 0 0.3rem; }
  .clip-speed { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .clip-title { font-weight: 700; }
  .clip-caption { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.2rem; }
  .clip-grab { font-size: 0.8rem; }
</style>
